ErrorEnvelope.description:
Uniform error body for every 4xx/5xx response. Wire schema documented
in `docs/api.md`. `code` is a stable machine-readable token (no spaces);
`message` is human-readable; `hint` is an optional remediation pointer.

ReadinessDto.description:
Readiness probe response. `GET /readyz` returns 200 with `ready: true`
when the asset_root canonicalises and at least one URDF is discoverable;
otherwise 503 with `ready: false` and a populated `errors` list.
